# SIP Management Verification Checklist

- [x] Open http://localhost:3000/investments and login if needed
- [ ] Locate the "SBI" investment row in the Holdings Ledger table
- [ ] Find and click the "Manage SIP Skips & Status" button
- [ ] Verify SIP stats in the modal (Start Date, Deposits, Skipped Payments, Invested Capital)
- [ ] Toggle first installment to "Skipped" and verify
- [ ] Toggle second installment to "Skipped" and verify "Skipped Payments" count increases
- [ ] Click "Stop Plan" and confirm in warning modal
- [ ] Verify SIP status updates to "Plan Suspended / Cancelled"
- [ ] Click "Done" to close modal and report success
